'''Cinderclown Shoes''' are a [[footwear]] item purchased from the [[Volcano Dungeon#Shop|Volcano Dungeon Dwarf's shop]] for 100 [[Cinder Shard]]s.

It has the second highest rating of the game for each of [[Defense]] and [[Immunity]], behind respectively [[Dragonscale Boots]] (Defense +7) and [[Mermaid Boots]] (Immunity +8).

When the player is walking whilst wearing the Cinderclown shoes, a small continuous jingling sound can be heard.

